<title>CHINA: China's Hiesense group corp sales income up.</title>
<headline>China's Hiesense group corp sales income up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales revenue of China's Qingdao Hiesense Group Corp reached 2.51 billion yuan ($300 million) in 1996, company officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Total assets of the company, a television maker based in eastern province of Shandong, hit 2.8 billion yuan in 1996, a Qingdao Hiesense official said by telephone.</p>
<p>The company gave no figures for the previous year.</p>
<p>The company's television output rose to 800,000 units by the end of 1996 from 380,000 in 1993, the official said.</p>
<p>The group includes the Shanghai-listed Qingdao Hiesense Electric Co Ltd.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
